#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:18
msgid ""
"Framer's website is a cinematic, tool-obsessed dark canvas that radiates "
"the confidence of a design tool built by designers who worship craft. The"
" entire experience is drenched in pure black — not a warm charcoal or a "
"cozy dark gray, but an absolute void (`#000000`) that makes every "
"element, every screenshot, every typographic flourish feel like it's "
"floating in deep space. This is a website that treats its own product UI "
"as the hero art, embedding full-fidelity screenshots and interactive "
"demos directly into the narrative flow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:20
msgid ""
"The typography is the signature move: GT Walsheim with aggressively tight"
" letter-spacing (as extreme as -5.5px on 110px display text) creates "
"headlines that feel compressed, kinetic, almost spring-loaded — like "
"words under pressure that might expand at any moment. The transition to "
"Inter for body text is seamless, with extensive OpenType feature usage "
"(`cv01`, `cv05`, `cv09`, `cv11`, `ss03`, `ss07`) that gives even small "
"text a refined, custom feel. Framer Blue (`#0099ff`) is deployed "
"sparingly but decisively — as link color, border accents, and subtle ring"
" shadows — creating a cold, electric throughline against the warm-less "
"black."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:22
msgid ""
"The overall effect is a nightclub for web designers: dark, precise, "
"seductive, and unapologetically product-forward. Every section exists to "
"showcase what the tool can do, with the website itself serving as proof "
"of concept."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:24
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:25
msgid ""
"Pure black (`#000000`) void canvas — absolute dark, not warm or gray-"
"tinted"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:26
msgid ""
"GT Walsheim display font with extreme negative letter-spacing (-5.5px at "
"110px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:27
msgid "Framer Blue (`#0099ff`) as the sole accent color — cold, electric, precise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:28
msgid ""
"Pill-shaped buttons (40px–100px radius) — no sharp corners on interactive"
" elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:29
msgid "Product screenshots as hero art — the tool IS the marketing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:30
msgid ""
"Frosted glass button variants using `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)` on dark "
"surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:31
msgid "Extensive OpenType feature usage across Inter for refined micro-typography"
msgstr ""

