#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:95
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:96
msgid ""
"**Compression as personality**: GT Walsheim's extreme negative letter-"
"spacing (-5.5px at 110px) is the defining typographic gesture — headlines"
" feel spring-loaded, urgent, almost breathless"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:97
msgid ""
"**OpenType maximalism**: Inter is deployed with 6+ OpenType features "
"simultaneously (`cv01`, `cv05`, `cv09`, `cv11`, `ss03`, `ss07`), creating"
" a subtly custom feel even at body sizes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:98
msgid ""
"**Weight restraint on display**: All GT Walsheim usage is weight 500 "
"(medium) — never bold, never regular. This creates a confident-but-not-"
"aggressive display tone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:99
msgid ""
"**Ultra-tight line heights**: Display text at 0.85 line-height means "
"letters nearly overlap vertically — intentional density that rewards "
"reading at arm's length"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:101
msgid "4. Component Stylings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:103
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:104
msgid ""
"**Frosted Pill**: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)` background, black text "
"(`#000000`), pill shape (40px radius). The glass-effect button that lives"
" on dark surfaces — translucent, ambient, subtle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:105
msgid ""
"**Solid White Pill**: `rgb(255, 255, 255)` background, black text "
"(`#000000`), full pill shape (100px radius), padding `10px 15px`. The "
"primary CTA — clean, high-contrast on dark, unmissable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:106
msgid ""
"**Ghost**: No visible background, white text, relies on text styling "
"alone. Hover reveals subtle frosted background"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:107
msgid ""
"**Transition**: Scale-based animations (matrix transform with 0.85 scale "
"factor), opacity transitions for reveal effects"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:109
msgid "Cards & Containers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:110
msgid ""
"**Dark Surface Card**: Black or near-black (`#090909`) background, "
"`rgba(0, 153, 255, 0.15) 0px 0px 0px 1px` blue ring shadow border, "
"rounded corners (10px–15px radius)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:111
msgid ""
"**Elevated Card**: Multi-layer shadow — `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 0px "
"0.5px 0px 0.5px` (subtle top highlight) + `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 0px 10px "
"30px` (deep ambient shadow)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:112
msgid ""
"**Product Screenshots**: Full-width or padded within dark containers, "
"8px–12px border-radius for software UI previews"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:113
msgid ""
"**Hover**: Subtle glow increase on Framer Blue ring shadow, or brightness"
" shift on frosted surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:115
msgid "Inputs & Forms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:116
msgid "Minimal form presence on the marketing site"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:117
msgid "Input fields follow dark theme: dark background, subtle border, white text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:118
msgid "Focus state: Framer Blue (`#0099ff`) ring border, `1px solid #0099ff`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:119
msgid "Placeholder text in `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:121
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:122
msgid ""
"**Dark floating nav bar**: Black background with frosted glass effect, "
"white text links"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:123
msgid ""
"**Nav links**: Inter at 15px, weight 400, white text with subtle hover "
"opacity change"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:124
msgid ""
"**CTA button**: Pill-shaped, white or frosted, positioned at right end of"
" nav"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:125
msgid "**Mobile**: Collapses to hamburger menu, maintains dark theme"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:126
msgid "**Sticky behavior**: Nav remains fixed at top on scroll"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:128
msgid "Image Treatment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:129
msgid ""
"**Product screenshots as hero art**: Full-width embedded UI screenshots "
"with rounded corners (8px–12px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:130
msgid ""
"**Dark-on-dark composition**: Screenshots placed on black backgrounds "
"with subtle shadow for depth separation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:131
msgid "**16:9 and custom aspect ratios**: Product demos fill their containers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:132
msgid ""
"**No decorative imagery**: All images are functional — showing the tool, "
"the output, or the workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:134
msgid "Trust & Social Proof"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:135
msgid "Customer logos and testimonials in muted gray on dark surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:136
msgid "Minimal ornamentation — the product screenshots serve as the trust signal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:138
msgid "5. Layout Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:140
msgid "Spacing System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:141
msgid "**Base unit**: 8px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:142
msgid ""
"**Scale**: 1px, 2px, 3px, 4px, 5px, 6px, 8px, 10px, 12px, 15px, 20px, "
"30px, 35px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:143
msgid "**Section padding**: Large vertical spacing (80px–120px between sections)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:144
msgid "**Card padding**: 15px–30px internal padding"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:145
msgid "**Component gaps**: 8px–20px between related elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:147
msgid "Grid & Container"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:148
msgid "**Max width**: ~1200px container, centered"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:149
msgid ""
"**Column patterns**: Full-width hero, 2-column feature sections, single-"
"column product showcases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:150
msgid ""
"**Asymmetric layouts**: Feature sections often pair text (40%) with "
"screenshot (60%)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:152
msgid "Whitespace Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:153
msgid ""
"**Breathe through darkness**: Generous vertical spacing between sections "
"— the black background means whitespace manifests as void, creating "
"dramatic pauses between content blocks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:154
msgid ""
"**Dense within, spacious between**: Individual components are tightly "
"composed (tight line-heights, compressed text) but float in generous "
"surrounding space"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:155
msgid ""
"**Product-first density**: Screenshot areas are allowed to be dense and "
"information-rich, contrasting with the sparse marketing text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:157
msgid "Border Radius Scale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:158
msgid "**1px**: Micro-elements, nearly squared precision edges"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:159
msgid "**5px–7px**: Small UI elements, image thumbnails — subtly softened"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:160
msgid ""
"**8px**: Standard component radius — code blocks, buttons, interactive "
"elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:161
msgid "**10px–12px**: Cards, product screenshots — comfortably rounded"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:162
msgid "**15px–20px**: Large containers, feature cards — generously rounded"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:163
msgid "**30px–40px**: Navigation pills, pagination — noticeably rounded"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:164
msgid "**100px**: Full pill shape — primary CTAs, tag elements"
msgstr ""

