"10px 30px`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md
msgid ""
"Elevated cards, floating elements — subtle white top-edge highlight + "
"deep ambient shadow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:175
msgid "Shadow Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:176
msgid ""
"Framer's elevation system is inverted from traditional light-theme "
"designs. Instead of darker shadows on light backgrounds, Framer uses:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:177
msgid ""
"**Blue-tinted ring shadows** at very low opacity (0.15) for containment —"
" a signature move that subtly brands every bordered element"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:178
msgid ""
"**White edge highlights** (0.5px) on the top edge of elevated elements — "
"simulating light hitting the top surface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:179
msgid ""
"**Deep ambient shadows** for true floating elements — `rgba(0, 0, 0, "
"0.25)` at large spread (30px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:181
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:182
msgid ""
"**Blue glow auras**: Subtle Framer Blue (`#0099ff`) radial gradients "
"behind key interactive areas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:183
msgid ""
"**No background blur/glassmorphism**: Despite the frosted button effect, "
"there's no heavy glass blur usage — the translucency is achieved through "
"simple rgba opacity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:185
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:187
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:188
msgid ""
"Use pure black (`#000000`) as the primary background — not dark gray, not"
" charcoal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:189
msgid ""
"Apply extreme negative letter-spacing on GT Walsheim display text (-3px "
"to -5.5px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:190
msgid ""
"Keep all buttons pill-shaped (40px+ radius) — never use squared or "
"slightly-rounded buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:191
msgid ""
"Use Framer Blue (`#0099ff`) exclusively for interactive accents — links, "
"borders, focus states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:192
msgid ""
"Deploy `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)` for frosted glass surfaces on dark "
"backgrounds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:193
msgid "Maintain GT Walsheim at weight 500 only — the medium weight IS the brand"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:194
msgid ""
"Use extensive OpenType features on Inter text (cv01, cv05, cv09, cv11, "
"ss03, ss07)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:195
msgid ""
"Let product screenshots be the visual centerpiece — the tool markets "
"itself"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:196
msgid ""
"Apply blue ring shadows (`rgba(0, 153, 255, 0.15) 0px 0px 0px 1px`) for "
"card containment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:198
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:199
msgid "Use warm dark backgrounds (no `#1a1a1a`, `#2d2d2d`, or brownish blacks)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:200
msgid "Apply bold (700+) weight to GT Walsheim display text — medium 500 only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:201
msgid ""
"Introduce additional accent colors beyond Framer Blue — this is a one-"
"accent-color system"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:202
msgid ""
"Use large border-radius on non-interactive elements (cards use 10px–15px,"
" only buttons get 40px+)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:203
msgid ""
"Add decorative imagery, illustrations, or icons — the product IS the "
"illustration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:204
msgid ""
"Use positive letter-spacing on headlines — everything is compressed, "
"negative tracking"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:205
msgid ""
"Create heavy drop shadows — depth is communicated through subtle rings "
"and minimal ambients"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:206
msgid "Place light/white backgrounds behind content sections — the void is sacred"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:207
msgid ""
"Use serif or display-weight fonts — the system is geometric sans-serif "
"only"
msgstr ""

