#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:253
msgid "Iteration Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:254
msgid "When refining existing screens generated with this design system:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:255
msgid ""
"Focus on ONE component at a time — the dark canvas makes each element "
"precious"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:256
msgid ""
"Always verify letter-spacing on GT Walsheim headings — the extreme "
"negative tracking is non-negotiable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:257
msgid ""
"Check that Framer Blue appears ONLY on interactive elements — never as "
"decorative background or text color for non-links"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:258
msgid ""
"Ensure all buttons are pill-shaped — any squared corner immediately "
"breaks the Framer aesthetic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_framer.md:259
msgid ""
"Test frosted glass surfaces by checking they have exactly `rgba(255, 255,"
" 255, 0.1)` — too opaque looks like a bug, too transparent disappears"
msgstr ""

